{"name": "Wanderling", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"172\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859530/extras/c9eee3aff9a10df60e98906e64f0859f.poster.avif?t=1771099019\" width=\"630\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859530/extras/c9eee3aff9a10df60e98906e64f0859f.webm?t=1771099019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859530/extras/c9eee3aff9a10df60e98906e64f0859f.mp4?t=1771099019\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this roguelike platformer, you play as the sandmouse to descend into a maze-like dungeon. Test your map-sense and mark your way through each level to find the optimal paths. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"172\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859530/extras/d5c80068692269dcf15db80bcda88479.poster.avif?t=1771099019\" width=\"630\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859530/extras/d5c80068692269dcf15db80bcda88479.webm?t=1771099019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859530/extras/d5c80068692269dcf15db80bcda88479.mp4?t=1771099019\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each day, you'll need to loot the dungeon and find your way back to the shop before night falls. There, you can purchase various upgrades to push further on the following days within the same run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859530/extras/f2534c7f723638d87138bd3ffd34cc22.apng?t=1771099019\"/><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"172\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859530/extras/f2534c7f723638d87138bd3ffd34cc22.poster.avif?t=1771099019\" width=\"631\"/></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Besides enemies and traps, you'll have to race against time. Plan your route and rush through the dungeon to make it out before time's up!<br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"172\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859530/extras/02afd19adec94326a0d0abf96398f716.poster.avif?t=1771099019\" width=\"631\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859530/extras/02afd19adec94326a0d0abf96398f716.webm?t=1771099019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expansive procedurally-generated levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Place sunflags to mark the way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast-paced, challenging gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge modifiers for adjusting game difficulty and level size</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mid-run shop with upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multi-day runs\u20148 tries to beat each  dungeon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Day/night sequence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Short, 20\u201330 minute runs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trailer Music by Major Bruno</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Wanderling is a no-combat roguelike platformer about exploration. Die, retry, and mark your path deeper into a dungeon filled with traps and enemies. You get 8 tries to gain the upgrades and map knowledge needed to clear each dungeon.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859530/e52370b6b93634feaac639823c6c2faed65af09b/header.jpg?t=1771099019", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["2D Platformer", "Action Roguelike", "Difficult", "Action", "Perma Death", "Platformer"], "developers": "Rosday", "publishers": "Rosday", "release_date": "Jan 26, 2026", "price": "$7.99", "appid": "2859530", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "26 January 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/Q6NlgmxhchI", "first_seen": 1769382000.0, "review_rank": 1337}